# Sutram — संस्कृतम्  (Sanskrit, Devanagari script)
#
# The core keywords are already Sanskrit; this program writes them in their own
# script and uses the danda । as the statement terminator.  Compile with:
#
#     sutram --lang sanskrit 218_sanskrit_devanagari.sm out.bin
#
# Every construct here is the ordinary language — only the spelling is new.

मुख्य()
    वित्ति योग = 0।
    वित्ति इ = 1।
    यावत् (इ <= 5) {
        योग = योग + इ।
        इ = इ + 1।
    }
    लिख("योगः = ")।
    लिख(योग)।
